<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>RDS - HOme</title>
  <style>
    body {
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);
      color: white;
      text-align: center;
      font-family: 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;
      height: 100vh;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: center;
      margin: 0;
    }
    .btn {
      background: #fff;
      color: #764ba2;
      padding: 10px 20px;
      text-decoration: none;
      border-radius: 25px;
      font-weight: bold;
      transition: 0.3s;
    }
    .btn:hover {
      background: #2ecc71;
      color: white;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <%- include('partials/header') %>
  <h1>Selamat Datang di RDS -Home</h1>
  <p>Server Node.js say sekarang sudah bisa baca file HTML!</p>
  <form action="/greet" method="POST" style="margin-top:  20px;">
      <input type="text" name="nama" placeholder="Masukan Nama Anda...." required
            style="padding: 10px; border-radius: 5px; border: none;"">
            <button type="submit" style="padding: 10px; cursor: pointer; border-radius: 5px; border:none; background-color: #2ecc71; color: white; font-weight: bold;">
              Sapa Saya
            </button>     
  </form>
</body>
</html>